://github.com/MatterHackers/agg-sharp/commit/07a830b077b80e9d11a066a90ca19678f2faea5a","commit_subject":"The window no longer freezes while a long operation such as an exact Dilate runs: parallel loops started on the UI thread now run on that thread instead of waiting on a thread pool the operation keeps busy. Building a selection handle's trace data used a Parallel.For on the UI thread, whose loop replicas sat unscheduled behind the Dilate's nested parallel work for minutes, once per handle. MatterHackers.Agg.Parallel gains a per-thread inline mark (RunInlineOnCurrentThread / CurrentThreadRunsInline): For, ForEach, Invoke and the loop-state For<T> pass MaxDegreeOfParallelism = 1 on the default scheduler from a marked thread, so every iteration runs on the caller with the parallel path's exception shape and ParallelLoopState. UiThread.MarkCurrentThreadAsUiThread, which every platform host reaches from its pump, marks the UI thread. ParallelInlineOnMarkedThreadTests and UiThreadPumpIdentityTests.ThePumpThreadRunsParallelLoopsInline pin both. Browser frame-tick tests run their ticks on a dedicated thread so no test leaves a pool worker marked.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"DataDog/build-plugins","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-02T23:03:48Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"d0dec913b956486628de84364860440503b9280c","github_link":"https://github.com/DataDog/build-plugins/commit/d0dec913b956486628de84364860440503b9280c","commit_subject":"fix(live-debugger): bump picomatch to 4.0.7","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"marko-js/marko","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-02T23:03:43Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"67a4665d043b1130a5718f662412334630f0be62","github_link":"https://github.com/marko-js/marko/commit/67a4665d043b1130a5718f662412334630f0be62","commit_subject":"fix(runtime-tags): read a hoisted tag variable only through its getter","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"vtex/faststore","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-02T23:03:41Z","branch":"dev","commit_sha":"3c58a213d237f8d5f7919ab12